      <div class="lightning-bg" aria-hidden="true"></div>
      <h1 data-a="words"><span class="w"><span style="--i: 0;">Trouve</span></span> <span class="w"><span style="--i: 1;">ton</span></span> <span class="w"><span style="--i: 2;">coach</span></span> <span class="w"><span style="--i: 3;">sportif</span></span> <span class="w"><span style="--i: 4;">à</span></span> <span class="w"><span style="--i: 5;">Orléans.</span></span></h1>
      <p class="lead" data-a="up">7 coachs sportifs diplômés dans 5 salles Basic-Fit autour d'Orléans. Chacun coache dans sa salle : trouve celui qui colle à ton objectif, près de chez toi.</p>
      <div class="ctas" data-a="up">
        <a class="btn btn-primary" href="/trouver-un-coach/">Trouver mon coach</a>
        <a class="btn btn-ghost" href="/salles/">Voir les salles</a>
      </div>
      <p class="hero-score" data-a="up">🎯 Pas sûr de ton objectif ? <a href="/score-sante/">Fais ton Score Santé en 2 minutes</a> ou <a href="#reserver">réserve ton bilan en 3 clics</a>.</p>
      <ul class="facts" data-a="up">
        <li>7 coachs du réseau</li>
        <li>5 salles partenaires</li>
        <li>63 villes couvertes</li>
        <li>196 avis Google</li>
      </ul>
      <div class="fan-wrap" id="fanWrap" style="--fan-s: 1.000;"><div class="fan" id="fan"><a class="card" href="/coachs/garry-babaud/" aria-label="Garry Olivet : voir le profil de Garry Babaud, Basic-Fit Olivet"><div class="card-lift"><div class="card-flip"><div class="card-face"><img src="/images/coachs/garry-babaud.webp" alt="" width="156" height="208"><div class="card-name">Garry</div><div class="card-salle">📍 Olivet</div></div><div class="card-back"><img src="/images/logos/ga-coachs-logo.webp" alt="" width="240" height="237"></div></div></div></a><a class="card" href="/coachs/yanis-trepy-lujien/" aria-label="Yanis Saran : voir le profil de Yanis Trépy-Lujien, Basic-Fit Saran"><div class="card-lift"><div class="card-flip"><div class="card-face"><img src="/images/coachs/yanis-trepy-lujien.webp" alt="" width="156" height="208"><div class="card-name">Yanis</div><div class="card-salle">📍 Saran</div></div><div class="card-back"><img src="/images/logos/ga-coachs-logo.webp" alt="" width="240" height="237"></div></div></div></a><a class="card" href="/coachs/nathan-sapin/" aria-label="Nathan Olivet : voir le profil de Nathan Sapin, Basic-Fit Olivet"><div class="card-lift"><div class="card-flip"><div class="card-face"><img src="/images/coachs/nathan-sapin.webp" alt="" width="156" height="208"><div class="card-name">Nathan</div><div class="card-salle">📍 Olivet</div></div><div class="card-back"><img src="/images/logos/ga-coachs-logo.webp" alt="" width="240" height="237"></div></div></div></a><a class="card" href="/coachs/thomas-das-neves/" aria-label="Thomas Fleury-les-Aubrais : voir le profil de Thomas Das Neves, Basic-Fit Fleury-les-Aubrais"><div class="card-lift"><div class="card-flip"><div class="card-face"><img src="/images/coachs/thomas-das-neves.webp" alt="" width="156" height="208"><div class="card-name">Thomas</div><div class="card-salle">📍 Fleury-les-Aubrais</div></div><div class="card-back"><img src="/images/logos/ga-coachs-logo.webp" alt="" width="240" height="237"></div></div></div></a><a class="card" href="/coachs/fabien-rakotoarimanana/" aria-label="Fabien Orléans Sud : voir le profil de Fabien Rakotoarimanana, Basic-Fit Orléans Sud"><div class="card-lift"><div class="card-flip"><div class="card-face"><img src="/images/coachs/fabien-rakotoarimanana.webp" alt="" width="156" height="208"><div class="card-name">Fabien</div><div class="card-salle">📍 Orléans Sud</div></div><div class="card-back"><img src="/images/logos/ga-coachs-logo.webp" alt="" width="240" height="237"></div></div></div></a><a class="card" href="/coachs/brice-chopin/" aria-label="Brice Olivet : voir le profil de Brice Chopin, Basic-Fit Olivet"><div class="card-lift"><div class="card-flip"><div class="card-face"><img src="/images/coachs/brice-chopin.webp" alt="" width="156" height="208"><div class="card-name">Brice</div><div class="card-salle">📍 Olivet</div></div><div class="card-back"><img src="/images/logos/ga-coachs-logo.webp" alt="" width="240" height="237"></div></div></div></a><a class="card" href="/coachs/alexis-fernandez/" aria-label="Alexis Orléans Libération : voir le profil de Alexis Fernandez, Basic-Fit Orléans Libération"><div class="card-lift"><div class="card-flip"><div class="card-face"><img src="/images/coachs/alexis-fernandez.webp" alt="" width="156" height="208"><div class="card-name">Alexis</div><div class="card-salle">📍 Orléans Libération</div></div><div class="card-back"><img src="/images/logos/ga-coachs-logo.webp" alt="" width="240" height="237"></div></div></div></a></div></div>
      <div class="shuffle-row" data-a="up">
        <button type="button" class="btn-shuffle" id="shuffle">
          <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#2F6FED" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M16 3h5v5"></path><path d="M4 20L21 3"></path><path d="M21 16v5h-5"></path><path d="M15 15l6 6"></path><path d="M4 4l5 5"></path></svg>
          Mélanger les cartes
        </button>
      </div>
      <p class="doors-k" data-a="up">Tu viens pour…</p>
      <div class="doors" data-a="up">
        <a class="door" href="#quiz">
          <span class="door-ic"><svg class="ic" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><use href="#i-user"></use></svg></span>
          <span class="door-t"><b>Toi</b><small>Trouve le coach qui correspond à ton objectif</small></span>
          <span class="door-go"><svg class="ic" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><use href="#i-arrow"></use></svg></span>
        </a>
        <a class="door is-hot" href="/entreprises/">
          <span class="door-ic"><svg class="ic" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><use href="#i-building"></use></svg></span>
          <span class="door-t"><b>Ton entreprise <span class="door-tag">Nouveau</span></b><small>BOOST ENTREPRISE™ · BOOST 30 offert</small></span>
          <span class="door-go"><svg class="ic" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><use href="#i-arrow"></use></svg></span>
        </a>
        <a class="door" href="/preparation-physique/clubs/">
          <span class="door-ic"><svg class="ic" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><use href="#i-trophy"></use></svg></span>
          <span class="door-t"><b>Ton club sportif</b><small>BOOST CLUB · diagnostic offert</small></span>
          <span class="door-go"><svg class="ic" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><use href="#i-arrow"></use></svg></span>
        </a>
      </div>
    </section>
